      "cooked": "<p>I reply as a regular person who is of course not at all related to the OP, that the talk about Inverseverse Grimm reminded me of a half-joke I made on my comics sideblog a while back that there must be a licensed crossover in the metaverse where Alan Wake somehow combats Grimm because… like… Inverseverse Grimm is basically Alan Wake and that amuses me.</p>",
