      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
      "created_at": "2024-07-24T12:47:38.767Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Every once in a while, I’ll stream a game against Miss Information and lose, and every time, my first thought is always, “Why are they playing the Editor’s Note theme?”</p>\n<p>I think the chin tucks are a good ad for the Patreon, we’ve all been doing them all weekend and thus have a four-day lead on spinal health over the rest of the listeners. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\"> The Letters Page, it’s good for you actually!</p>\n<p>I wonder what the chances are of us getting chin tuck contect in Definitive Edition. &lt;_&lt; I could see Stuntman doing level 7 chin tucks, along with the semi truck splits, for Training Montage?</p>\n<p>I still need to get myself a giant Cheez-It, dammit.</p>\n<p>I am SO looking forward to the next PGP now. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\"></p>\n<p>No shade, but the reveal that metaverse C&amp;A are boomers is very “idea created as a young/pre-teen”. XD “And by the 90’s, with the comics boom, we’ll be grown adults!” kind of thing.</p>\n<p>Ooh, I can take credit for the outro gag! XD</p>",
      "post_number": 3,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2024-07-24T12:47:38.767Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
